<!DOCTYPE html> <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="ja-JP" xml:lang="ja-JP" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"><head> <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"> <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{cbee19c7-84da-4759-aac0-9d3ea9f86b7f}_TemplateFavicon-32x32.png"> <title>インテル デベロッパー・ゾーン・プレミアのユーザーは、インテル パートナー・アライアンスに参加できるようになりました。​</title> <style>:root {color-scheme: light} @media only screen { html { min-height: 100%;} } /*Eloqua footer overrides*/ .footer_elq {height:auto!important;} .center {background-color:#efefef !important;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;border: 0px solid #efefef !important;padding-top:10px !important;padding-bottom: 10px !important;} .center p, .center span {color: #262626 !important} .center a, .center strong {color: #0054AE!important} .spacer {visibility:hidden;mso-hide:all;display:none;} @media only screen and (max-width:695px) { .top {display : table-header-group !important ;width : 100% !important ;} .bottom {display : table-footer-group !important ;width : 100% !important ;} .pad-top-24 {padding-top:24px!important} .pad-bottom-24 {padding-bottom:24px!important} .no-mobile-border {border:0!important} .small-text-center {text-align: center!important} .small-text-left {text-align: left!important} .small-text-right {text-align: right!important} .small-float-center {margin: 0 auto!important;float: none!important; text-align: center!important} .mobile-logo {margin: 30px auto!important;} .mobile-logo-left {margin-top: 30px!important; margin-bottom: 30px!important;} table.body center {min-width: 0!important} table.body .container {width: 100%!important}table.body .columns {height: auto!important;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 25px!important;padding-right: 25px!important} table.body .collapse .columns { padding-left: 0!important;padding-right: 0!important} th.small-1 {display: inline-block!important;width: 8.33333%!important}th.small-2 {display: inline-block!important;width: 16.66667%!important}th.small-3 {display: inline-block!important; width: 25%!important}th.small-4 {display: inline-block!important;width: 33.33334%!important} th.small-5 {display: inline-block!important;width: 41.66667%!important}th.small-6 {display: inline-block!important;width: 50%!important}th.small-9 {display: inline-block!important;width: 75%!important}th.small-10 {display: inline-block!important;width: 83.33333%!important}th.small-11 {display: inline-block!important;width: 91.66667%!important}th.small-12 {display: inline-block!important;width: 100%!important} .responsive {width: 100%!important;height:auto!important;display: block} .show-for-small {display: block!important;mso-hide: none!important;width: 100%!important} table.show-for-small {display: table!important;width: 100%!important} .show-for-large {display: none!important;width: 0; mso-hide: all;overflow: hidden } table.body .columns.no-padding-mobile {padding-left: 0!important;padding-right: 0!important} th.callout-inner {padding-top: 25px!important;padding-bottom: 25px!important} th.callout-inner-sides {padding-left: 0!important;padding-right: 0!important}} /* Device Styles */ a[x-apple-data-detectors] {color: inherit!important;text-decoration: none!important;font-size: inherit!important;font-family: inherit!important;font-weight: inherit!important;line-height: inherit!important;text-decoration: none!important} span.MsoHyperlink { mso-style-priority: 99; color: inherit;text-decoration: none!important } span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed { mso-style-priority: 99; color: inherit;text-decoration: none!important } #MessageViewBody a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit}</style><!--[if gte mso 9]> <xml> <o:OfficeDocumentSettings> <o:AllowPNG/> <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch> </o:OfficeDocumentSettings> </xml> <![endif]--> <!--[if gte mso 9]> <style> sup { font-size: 100% !important; } a {text-decoration: none;} /* STYLE OVERRIDES FOR ELOQUA FOOTER */ .center { background-color:#efefef !important; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; border: 0px solid #efefef !important; padding-top:10px !important; padding-bottom: 10px !important;} .center p, .center span {color: #262626 !important} .center a, .center strong {color: #0054AE !important} .spacer {visibility:hidden;mso-hide:all;display:none;} </style> <![endif]--></head> <body style="background:#efefef;-moz-box-sizing:border-box;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;-webkit-box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#262626;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;line-height:24px;margin:0;min-width:100%;padding:0;text-align:left;width:100%!important"><!--START HIDDEN PREHEADER--> <span style="visibility:hidden;mso-hide:all;display:none;"><!-- Preheader text goes here --></span> <!--END PREHEADER--><table role="presentation" bgcolor="#efefef" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="body" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th align="center" valign="top" style="padding-top:24px;width:670px;"> <center style="min-width:0!important;width:100%"><!-- BEGIN EMAIL BODY --><table role="presentation" align="center" bgcolor="#262626" border="0" class="container" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="670"> <tbody> <tr> <th><!-- START HEADER --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns pad-bottom-24" style="padding-left:80px;padding-top:40px;text-align:left;width:100%"><img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{1ea7a4b0-77fb-4bf8-8fca-195a2ccec135}_347x108-Intel-IPA-logo.png" alt="" style="display:block;height:54px;width:174px;" height="54" valign="top" width="174"></th> </tr> </table> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;width:510px;"> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="middle" width="100%"> <tr> <th class="small-12" style="width:210px;" valign="bottom"> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="show-for-large" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="line-height:24px;font-size:24px;" height="24">&nbsp;</th> </tr> </tbody> </table> <img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{9fe13c0f-6051-4353-9666-41b69885ff6c}_hero_%281%29.jpg" alt="" class="responsive" style="display:block;height:210px;width:210px;" height="210" valign="top" width="210"></th> <th class="small-12 columns" style="background:#000000;width:310px;" valign="middle"> <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="collapse" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns pad-bottom-24 pad-top-24" style="padding:20px;"> <h1 style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:24px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:30px;margin:0;margin-bottom:24.5px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;® デ&#xfeff;ベ&#xfeff;ロ&#xfeff;ッパ&#xfeff;ー・ゾ&#xfeff;ー&#xfeff;ン・プレミアの価値に加え&#xfeff;、追加の特典を獲得ください&#xfeff;！</h1> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tr> <th style="min-width:200px;"> <!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="auto"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="background:#ffffff;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/jp/ja/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#006ABB;display:block;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;&reg; パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・アライアンスに参加する<img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{d10a0171-9566-461e-b39d-83894db2af31}_arrow_email_blue.png" valign="middle" alt=""></a></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th> </tr> </table> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table> </th> </tr> </table> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END HEADER --> <!-- START ACCOUNT INFO --> <table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-top:48px;width:510px;"> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="collapse" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="text-align:left;width:255px"> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">姓:{!Contact.FirstName}</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">名： {!Contact.LastName}</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">ユ&#xfeff;ーザ&#xfeff;ー名 (メ&#xfeff;ールアドレス): {!Contact.Email}</p> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><br></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END ACCOUNT INFO --> <!-- START LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-bottom:24px;width:510px;"> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;®デベロッパー・ゾーンの特典として&#xfeff;、弊社の機密リソースおよびセキュアコンテンツへのアクセスが可能ですが&#xfeff;、この度イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;® パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・アライアンスの特典の一環となりました&#xfeff;。貴重なインテル® デベロッパー・ゾーンの価値あるユーザーとして&#xfeff;、今すぐIntel Partner Allianceプログラムにご参加いただけます&#xfeff;。</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">お客様の会社はすでにイ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;® パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・アライアンスの価値あるメンバーです。この機会に、すでにプログラムに参加している同僚と共に&#xfeff;、類をみないかつ高く評価された特典をご利用ください&#xfeff;。具体的な例を紹介しましょう&#xfeff;。</p> <ul style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none"> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;"><strong>イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;&reg; パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・ユニバ&#xfeff;ーシテ&#xfeff;ィ&#xfeff;ー</strong>を通じて&#xfeff;、800 を超える世界レベルのコ&#xfeff;ース&#xfeff;、30 を超えるコンピテンシ&#xfeff;ーと認定&#xfeff;、業界の動向&#xfeff;、ビジネス予測など&#xfeff;、重要な知識にアクセスできます&#xfeff;。</li> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">対象となるインテル製品の購入やビジネス構築活動を通じて<strong>ポイント</strong>を獲得できます。貴重なビジネスニ&#xfeff;ーズにポイントをご利用ください。</li> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">厳選された業界トピ&#xfeff;ックおよびタスクに特化した<strong>アクテ&#xfeff;ィベ&#xfeff;ーシ&#xfeff;ョン・ゾ&#xfeff;ーン</strong>では、インテルのテクノロジ&#xfeff;ーをベ&#xfeff;ースとした製品やソリ&#xfeff;ュ&#xfeff;ーシ&#xfeff;ョンを構築&#xfeff;、マ&#xfeff;ーケテ&#xfeff;ィング&#xfeff;、販売するためのリソ&#xfeff;ースを提供します&#xfeff;。</li> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;® パートナーショーケースを通じ、貴社専用のウェブページにてソリ&#xfeff;ュ&#xfeff;ーシ&#xfeff;ョンを告知、エコシステム全体で何千ものパ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ーやエンドユ&#xfeff;ーザ&#xfeff;ーとつながることができます&#xfeff;。</li> </ul> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">今すぐ連絡先として登録すると、貴社に 100 ポイント* が付与され、イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;® パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・アライアンスとイ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;® デベロ&#xfeff;ッパ&#xfeff;ー・ゾ&#xfeff;ーン・プレミアが提供するすべての特典を体験できるようになります。</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">次の簡単な手順に従&#xfeff;ってください。</p> <ol style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none"> <li style="margin-bottom:20px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/jp/ja/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">[今すぐ登録]</a> をクリ&#xfeff;ックし、プロンプト** に従&#xfeff;って会社のアカウントにリンクします。</li> <li style="margin-bottom:20px;">確認されると、イ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;&reg; パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・アライアンスにログインするためのメ&#xfeff;ールが届きます。</li> </ol> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">プログラムが提供するすべての特典をご確認の上、今すぐイ&#xfeff;ン&#xfeff;テ&#xfeff;ル&#xfeff;&reg; パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・アライアンスにご参加ください。</p> <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="padding-top:32px;"><!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="auto"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="background:#00C7FD ;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/jp/ja/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#262626;display:block;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">今すぐ登録<img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{3c6395e2-a99d-4d56-af68-36b36f3ef629}_arrow_email_black.png" valign="middle" alt=""></a></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- START SPACER --><table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th align="center" style="font-size:14px;line-height:14px;width:100%" height="14"> &nbsp; </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END SPACER --><p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-top:32px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー登録でヘルプが必要ですか？<a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/jp/ja/support.html?elqTrackId=e8aebb5fa57546dab808d4902c25087c&elqTrack=true" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">サポ&#xfeff;ートにお問い合わせください</a>。</p><!-- START SPACER --><table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th align="center" style="font-size:20px;line-height:20px;width:100%" height="20"> &nbsp; </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END SPACER --><p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">*ポイント対象者であることが条件となります。応募資格をご覧ください。</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin-top:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/jp/ja/support/articles/000092340/programs/access-entitlement-for-myintel-users.html?wapkw=azure%20mfa%20help&elqTrackId=0f654af1184b4c4a9c97cb0ecda4c3c0&elqTrack=true" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:normal;word-wrap:none">*<u>Azure 多要素認証 (MFA) ヘルプ</u></a></p> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --> <!-- START IPA SOCIAL RIBBON - UPDATE THE BACKGROUND COLOR ON THE BLADE BY CHANGING THIS TABLE BACKGROUND --><table role="presentation" align="center" bgcolor="#0095CA" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th> <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" valign="middle" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th align="center" style="padding:10px;"> <div style="vertical-align: middle"><img alt="" height="30" src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{04d8272d-eac1-4a18-8060-873796cf5819}_icon_ipa_linkedin.png" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" valign="middle" width="39" /> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/groups/2965079/?elqTrackId=37baac48d4f24cba9407883e64b74cee&elqTrack=true" style="color:#fff;font-family:'Yu Gothic','MS PGothic','ＭＳ Ｐゴシック','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;line-height:30px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;" target="_blank"><span style="text-decoration:underline">LinkedIn</span> のインテル&reg; パ&#xfeff;ートナ&#xfeff;ー・アライアンス・グル&#xfeff;ープに参加する</a><img alt="" src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{0230aada-0914-45c2-8d44-ea2c5ae34e04}_arrow_email_white.png" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" valign="middle" /></div> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END IPA SOCIAL RIBBON --> <!-- START SIGNOFF BLADE - UPDATE THE BACKGROUND COLOR ON THE BLADE BY CHANGING THIS TABLE BACKGROUND --><table role="presentation" valign="top" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#0054AE" align="center"> <tbody> <tr> <th> <center><img align="middle" alt="つながる。イノベーション。成長。" class="responsive" height="80" src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{c37e4460-0e1e-45c0-b554-638a1a